<title>USA: IPO FILING - Monterey Resources Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Monterey Resources Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Monterey Resources Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			n/a</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   n/a/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    7.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 7.9 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    53,250,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  n/a</p>
<p>Business: The Bakersfield, Calif.,-based company, currently a unit of Santa Fe Energy Resources Inc, is an oil and gas production and development company.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay debt, including that owed to Santa Fe Energy Resources, and the balance, for working capital.</p>
